# com.android.providers.media.module (uid 10323, mediaprovider_app) looks up the
# "isub" (subscription) binder service at startup. Stock plat policy grants no
# mediaprovider_app -> radio_service access either, so the find denial is
# stock-identical and benign: the lookup just fails and is handled. Silence it.
dontaudit mediaprovider_app radio_service:service_manager find;
